  "title": "Restaurant Website Creator",
  "description": "Creates restaurant, cafe, bar, and bakery brand showcase pages with menu systems, reservation forms, chef teams, and gallery. Features warm appetite-stimulating color palettes, serif typography, full-bleed food photography. For fine dining restaurants, cafes, bars, bakeries, pastry shops, and private kitchens.",
